First release.

Press anywhere to fire a grapple at the anchor above you and get hauled in. Let go and you fly. Press again for the next one.

Let go at the top of the arc and the swing carries you through the sparks strung between anchors, chaining a multiplier. Let one fall behind you and the chain breaks.

Watch the anchors: violet ones drift, teal ones burn out the moment you leave them, gold ones fire you upward.

The void below never stops rising.
